#18602
A Cold Village~
   You stand at the entrance to a small farming village. The air is still 
and quite frigid. Several old burnt out buildings lie throughout the 
village and look as though they haven't been occupied in a very long time.
The ground shows no life of any form and has an odd purple color to it. You 
see no one about but you hear strange growling and moaning noises.
   There is a large building to the north and smaller buildings to the east.
There also is a wide open plain to the northwest and a trail taking you out 
of the village to the south.
